Project Development Phase – PocketSmart AI

The Project Development Phase is the stage where the planned design of PocketSmart AI: Your Smart Budget & Recommendation Assistant is converted into a working application. The main features are developed, integrated, and prepared for testing.

Development Activities

1. Frontend Development – Create a simple and user-friendly interface for login, dashboard, expenses, budget, and recommendations.


2. User Module – Develop registration and login functionality.


3. Income & Expense Module – Allow users to add, edit, delete, and categorize income and expenses.


4. Budget Module – Develop features to set monthly and category-wise budgets.


5. Database Development – Store user details, income, expenses, budgets, and savings goals securely.


6. Recommendation Module – Develop an AI/recommendation system that analyzes spending patterns and provides personalized suggestions.


7. Alert System – Notify users when their spending is approaching or exceeding their budget.


8. Report Module – Generate spending summaries, savings information, and charts.


9. Module Integration – Connect the frontend, backend, database, and recommendation system.


10. Initial Testing – Check each feature and fix errors during development.



Expected Result

At the end of the development phase, PocketSmart AI will have a functional system that helps users track expenses, manage budgets, analyze spending habits, save money, and receive smart personalized recommendations.
